        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Clear all Stages — ALL AT ONCE.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All At Once is a hardcore 2D platformer where you control tiny golden slime<strong><i>s</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong> </strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each stage is simple by itself, but you must control every slime <strong><i>simultaneously</i></strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/f2ff69e9efe4deef5272a0064cb33740.poster.avif?t=1756859414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/f2ff69e9efe4deef5272a0064cb33740.webm?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/f2ff69e9efe4deef5272a0064cb33740.mp4?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress, the difficulty ramps up — you'll be controlling more and more slimes at the same time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/31042285077f9b1ae2d8abe5e7f7756c.poster.avif?t=1756859414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/31042285077f9b1ae2d8abe5e7f7756c.webm?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/31042285077f9b1ae2d8abe5e7f7756c.mp4?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a variety of stages, each with unique conditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/e79971867463aace7d8aa5464ca1604a.poster.avif?t=1756859414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/e79971867463aace7d8aa5464ca1604a.webm?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/e79971867463aace7d8aa5464ca1604a.mp4?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/d8b37fab79a59b3a431453547067aa1b.poster.avif?t=1756859414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/d8b37fab79a59b3a431453547067aa1b.webm?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/d8b37fab79a59b3a431453547067aa1b.mp4?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/a5bbac398af09798fd6361c41d10f873.poster.avif?t=1756859414\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/a5bbac398af09798fd6361c41d10f873.webm?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935960/extras/a5bbac398af09798fd6361c41d10f873.mp4?t=1756859414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By the end, you might find yourself overwhelmed by the sheer number of slimes you need to control — <strong><i>all at once.</i></strong></p>",
